{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33389","headline":"下第後蒙侍郎示意指於新先辈宣恩感谢 · 李昌符","name":"下第後蒙侍郎示意指於新先辈宣恩感谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"才薄命如此，自嗟兼自疑。\n遭逢好文日，黜落至公时。\n倚玉甘无路，穿杨却未期。\n更慙君侍坐，问许可言诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李昌符","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33389.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33389","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}